| Table                   | Relationship                            |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Branches → Customers    | One branch has many customers           |
| Customers → Accounts    | One customer can have multiple accounts |
| Branches → Accounts     | One branch manages many accounts        |
| Accounts → Transactions | One account can have many transactions  |
| Customers → Loans       | One customer can have multiple loans    |
| Branches → Loans        | One branch manages many loans           |





